(KNUST-ATTENDANCE-APP is a modern institutional platform engineered to eradicate proxy attendance, streamline classroom) Tj
T* (management, automate the 10-mark continuous assessment computation, and deliver instant real-time communication across) Tj
T* (Kwame Nkrumah University of Science and Technology. By fusing dynamic cryptographic rotating QR codes, multi-camera scanning) Tj
T* (engines, geofencing coordinates, PWA offline resilience, and cross-device Web Push notifications, the application delivers a) Tj
T* (frictionless, tamper-proof attendance experience for both educators and students.) Tj
